    },
    {
      "nome": "texto5",
      "tipo": "texto",
      "exemplo": "While AI offers new avenues for artistic exploration, there is a concern that it may overshadow or replace human creativity. Balancing the integration of AI too"
    },
    {
      "nome": "rotulo11",
      "tipo": "texto",
      "exemplo": "Societal Impact"
    },
    {
      "nome": "texto6",
      "tipo": "texto",
      "exemplo": "As AI-generated art becomes more prevalent, its long-term impact on the art market, art institutions, and the broader societal perception of art needs to be car"
